1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:01,991
Welcome to 4-7-8 breathing.

2
00:00:02,772 --> 00:00:06,113
This practice uses a longer exhale to help the body settle.

3
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:23,777
We will breathe in for four counts, hold for seven counts, and breathe out for eight counts.

4
00:00:34,218 --> 00:00:39,862
If holding your breath does not feel good, you can shorten the hold or simply breathe gently.

5
00:00:49,828 --> 00:00:52,530
Let this be supportive, not forced.

6
00:00:54,206 --> 00:00:56,428
Begin by sitting or lying comfortably.

7
00:00:57,709 --> 00:00:59,130
Let your shoulders soften.

8
00:01:00,031 --> 00:01:01,212
Let your jaw loosen.

9
00:01:01,912 --> 00:01:04,875
Take one natural breath in and let it out.

10
00:01:05,856 --> 00:01:06,696
Now we'll begin.

11
00:01:07,817 --> 00:01:08,638
Breathe in.

12
00:01:18,706 --> 00:01:22,129
One, two, three, four, hold.

13
00:01:32,152 --> 00:01:55,672
one two three four five six seven exhale one two three four five six seven eight again breathe in

14
00:02:05,677 --> 00:02:09,080
One, two, three, four, hold.

15
00:02:19,230 --> 00:02:26,997
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, exhale.

16
00:02:36,504 --> 00:02:42,029
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

17
00:02:42,689 --> 00:02:45,252
Let the exhale be slow and easy.

18
00:02:55,420 --> 00:02:56,982
Again, inhale.

19
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:26,079
one two three four hold one two three four five six seven exhale

20
00:03:36,012 --> 00:03:42,176
One, two, three, four, five, and six, seven, eight.

21
00:03:43,497 --> 00:03:46,860
If you need to breathe normally at any time, do that.

22
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,542
Your body knows what it needs.

23
00:03:50,923 --> 00:03:52,764
Again, breathe in.

24
00:04:02,893 --> 00:04:06,735
One, two, three, four, hold.

25
00:04:16,678 --> 00:04:23,661
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, exhale.

26
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:40,302
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

27
00:04:41,163 --> 00:04:42,984
Now let's do a few quieter rounds.

28
00:04:43,604 --> 00:04:44,664
Breathe in for four.

29
00:04:55,349 --> 00:04:56,210
Hold for seven.

30
00:05:06,095 --> 00:05:07,055
Exhale for eight.

31
00:05:16,798 --> 00:05:18,738
Again, inhale.

32
00:05:28,661 --> 00:05:29,021
Hold.

33
00:05:38,970 --> 00:05:50,438
Exhale One more round.

34
00:05:51,399 --> 00:06:01,706
Inhale Hold

35
00:06:11,522 --> 00:06:12,162
Exhale.

36
00:06:22,107 --> 00:06:23,288
Now release the counting.

37
00:06:24,108 --> 00:06:26,530
Let your breath return to its natural rhythm.

38
00:06:36,315 --> 00:06:37,075
Notice your body.

39
00:06:49,741 --> 00:06:51,585
Notice whether anything has shifted.

40
00:06:52,366 --> 00:06:53,589
Maybe there is more calm.

41
00:06:54,711 --> 00:06:55,893
Maybe there is resistance.

42
00:06:56,615 --> 00:06:58,558
Maybe there is no obvious change.

43
00:06:59,801 --> 00:07:01,063
All of that is okay.

44
00:07:02,346 --> 00:07:06,353
Take one final natural breath in and let it out.

45
00:07:07,435 --> 00:07:09,499
When you are ready, return to the room.
